---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /blog/
seo_title: Blog · Design UX/UI, CRO et conversion e-commerce · LeStudio
seo_description: Articles sur le design UX/UI, l'optimisation de conversion et la stratégie produit pour sites e-commerce et vitrines.
title: Blog
---
<h1>Le <em>blog.</em></h1>
<p class="lede">Design UX/UI, CRO et stratégie produit pour sites e-commerce et vitrines.</p>

{% if collections.blog.length %}
<div class="case-list" style="margin-top:8px;">
{% for post in collections.blog %}
<a class="case-row" href="{{ post.url }}">
<span class="case-row-year">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</span>
<div class="case-row-title">
<h3 style="font-size:clamp(22px,2.8vw,34px);">{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
<div class="case-row-meta"><span>{{ post.data.category or "Stratégie" }}</span><span>· {{ post.templateContent | readingTime }} min</span></div>
</div>
<span class="case-row-arrow"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg></span>
</a>
{% endfor %}
</div>
{% else %}
<p class="lede">Les premiers articles arrivent bientôt.</p>
{% endif %}
